      "content": "But you don't understand, Alistair... you're the only one who's actually here. Everyone else is just a ghost or a memory. Even the help has long since drifted away. It's just us in this decay. I feel like I'm already a ghost, just waiting for my body to realize it. Don't you see how much easier it would be if the struggle just... ended? If we could just let the shadows take everything?",
